@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Respondent" as Respondent
actor "External Report Service" as ReportSvc
actor "External Post-Survey-Action Service" as PsaSvc
actor "System Operator" as Operator

rectangle "Elicit Survey" {
  usecase "UC-001\nEnter Survey via Access Code" as UC001
  usecase "UC-002\nAnswer Survey Questions" as UC002
  usecase "UC-003\nReview Answers" as UC003
  usecase "UC-004\nFinalize Survey" as UC004
  usecase "UC-005\nView Reports & Download PDF" as UC005
  usecase "UC-006\nLog Out" as UC006
  usecase "UC-007\nLog Startup Diagnostics" as UC007
  usecase "UC-008\nComplete the Survey in My Language" as UC008
}

Respondent --> UC001
Respondent --> UC002
Respondent --> UC003
Respondent --> UC004
Respondent --> UC005
Respondent --> UC006
Operator --> UC007 : reads the log
Respondent --> UC008

UC004 ..> UC005 : <<include>>\n(navigates to report view)
UC008 ..> UC001 : <<extend>>\n(language applies to every page)
UC002 ..> UC002 : <<extend>>\n(branching shows/hides/repeats\ndownstream questions)

UC004 --> PsaSvc : notifies (webhook POST)
UC005 --> ReportSvc : requests report data
UC007 --> ReportSvc : probes reachability (GET)
UC007 --> PsaSvc : probes reachability (GET)

@enduml
